  "question": {
    "text": "The ratio of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>14</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>12</mn></mmultiscripts></mfrac></math> in a piece of wood is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math> part that of atmosphere. If half life of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>14</mn></mmultiscripts></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5730</mn></math> years, the age of wood sample is ..... years.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "17190",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given half life of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>14</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mo> </mo><mn>5730</mn></math> years.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λt</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><msub><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>14</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>/</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>12</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow></mfenced><mtext>atmosphere </mtext></msub><msub><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>14</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>/</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>12</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow></mfenced><mtext>wood sample </mtext></msub></mfrac></math></p><p>As per the question,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>14</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>/</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>12</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow></mfenced><mi>wood</mi></msub><msub><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>14</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>/</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>12</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow></mfenced><mi>atmosphere</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λt</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo> </mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5730</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>17190</mn><mo> </mo><mtext>years</mtext></math></p>",
